(text "RFID readers (shared SPI bus, individual SDA/SS)" (at 91.44 17.78 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid a30f1fcb-7e09-4a09-803b-9e3d81c66945))
(text "LED matrix" (at 116.84 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 8a22a416-e4be-4675-8acf-32f8caecd6af))
(text "Buttons (to GND, internal pull-up)" (at 187.96 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.524 1.524) bold) (justify left top)) (uuid 0215beb2-3e83-4244-8161-3d9cb2ec8206))
(text "Notes:\n- Power the RC522 from 3.3 V - NOT 5 V!\n- SPI on the Mega: MISO = D50, MOSI = D51, SCK = D52 (also on the ICSP header).\n  D11-D13 are NOT SPI on the Mega!\n- SCK/MOSI/MISO and RST are shared by all 4 readers, SDA/SS is individual per reader.\n- D53 (hardware SS) stays unconnected; SPI.begin() keeps it an output.\n- The IRQ pin of the readers is not used.\n- Button 1 (D2) = confirm. Buttons use INPUT_PULLUP, pressed = LOW.\n- Interrupt pins on the Mega: D2, D3, D18, D19, D20, D21.\n- Buttons 2/3 (D3/D18) are reserved, not used by the firmware yet.\n- At low brightness the matrix can run from the Mega's 5V pin; for high brightness\n  use an external 5V power supply (common ground!)." (at 16.51 157.48 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid 7492d5b9-8d7a-4b53-8002-13acf656bcf4))
  (sheet_instances (path "/" (page "1")))
)
